---
title: Buttermilk Pancakes
servings: 4
time: 25 minutes
---

Whisk @flour{250%g}, @baking powder{2%tsp} and @sugar{2%tbsp} together in a #large bowl{}.

Beat @eggs{2} with @buttermilk{300%ml} and pour into the dry mix. Rest the batter for ~{10%minutes}.

Melt @butter{1%tbsp} in a #frying pan{} and cook each pancake for ~{2%minutes} per side.
